<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml"
    xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling"
    xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter"
    xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"
    xmlns:ebutts="urn:ebu:tt:style"
    ttp:timeBase="media"
    ttp:cellResolution="32 15"
    tts:extent="1920px 1080px"
    xml:lang="slv">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>Subtitles</ttm:title>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="text"
             tts:fontFamily="sansSerif"
             tts:fontSize="100%"
             tts:lineHeight="125%"
             tts:textAlign="center"
             tts:color="#FFFFFF"
             tts:backgroundColor="#000000C0"
             ebutts:linePadding="0.5c"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <!-- The conventional EBU-TT-D bottom region: the title-safe area, with
           displayAlign="after" pinning text to its bottom edge so multi-line
           cues grow upwards. Subtitles land where viewers expect them and where
           every other broadcaster puts them, which matters more than dodging
           the sign-language overlay — that is kept clear by defaulting the
           overlay to the top right instead. -->
      <region xml:id="bottom"
              tts:origin="10% 10%"
              tts:extent="80% 80%"
              tts:displayAlign="after"
              tts:writingMode="lrtb"
              tts:overflow="visible"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:01.290" end="00000:00:06.050"><span style="text">Vse kakor svetujem  uporabniku,<br/>da najprej poskusimo s popravilom,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:06.130" end="00000:00:09.630"><span style="text">ker stara naprava ravno<br/>tako deluje kot nova.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:18.772" end="00000:00:19.784"><span style="text">Dober dan!</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:19.844" end="00000:00:21.286"><span style="text">Dober dan, kar naprej.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:21.365" end="00000:00:25.690"><span style="text">Evo tukaj sem prinesla računalnik,<br/>to je od moje mame.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:25.853" end="00000:00:27.853"><span style="text">Nekaj so težave z njim.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:28.056" end="00000:00:30.788"><span style="text">Kar vzamite ga iz torbice,<br/>da pogledava.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:32.127" end="00000:00:35.851"><span style="text">Kakšne težave ima,<br/>ja je pa res malo starejši že.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:47.260" end="00000:00:50.260"><span style="text">Prenosnik je delujoč,<br/>greva v operacijski sistem,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:50.340" end="00000:00:51.540"><span style="text">sicer je zastarel.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:51.920" end="00000:00:56.840"><span style="text">Tukaj bi lahko poskusili s posodobitvijo<br/>na novejši operacijski sistem.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:00:58.340" end="00000:01:01.200"><span style="text">Vidimo, če prenosnik ima licenco.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:02.560" end="00000:01:06.120"><span style="text">Licenca je. Najbolje,<br/>da se to prevzame v servis,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:06.200" end="00000:01:09.107"><span style="text">da ga pregledamo, vas bomo obvestili.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:20.310" end="00000:01:24.830"><span style="text">Popravilo računalnikov bi<br/>jaz razdelil na dva dela.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:25.030" end="00000:01:26.910"><span style="text">Prvi del je tisti računalniški del,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:26.990" end="00000:01:30.050"><span style="text">kjer menjamo trde diske,<br/>spominske module,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:30.250" end="00000:01:33.470"><span style="text">pogledamo čez Windowsi kaj<br/>narobe ali tekoče deluje,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:33.534" end="00000:01:35.928"><span style="text">očistimo prah,<br/>tečaj in tako naprej.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:36.015" end="00000:01:40.940"><span style="text"> In to je enota,<br/>na katero se namesti operacijski</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:41.020" end="00000:01:44.120"><span style="text">sistem. Kamor se vse shranjuje,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:45.020" end="00000:01:46.260"><span style="text">To je trdi disk,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:46.460" end="00000:01:50.640"><span style="text">ta je zastarel in je šibka<br/>točka starejših prenosnikov.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:50.720" end="00000:01:56.000"><span style="text">Potem ga nadomestimo z elektronskim<br/>SSD diskom in bomo pripomogli,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:01:56.080" end="00000:02:00.580"><span style="text">da bo tole zadostovalo našim potrebam,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:00.700" end="00000:02:03.420"><span style="text">ko se tiče hitrosti in zmogljivosti.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:03.640" end="00000:02:08.080"><span style="text">Čeprav je računalnik že starejši,<br/>tako, to je stari disk,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:08.160" end="00000:02:12.400"><span style="text">Tega bomo nadomestili z novim<br/>elektronskim in to je to.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:18.620" end="00000:02:22.880"><span style="text">Kaj pa se zgodi,<br/>ko je prenosnik ima večje težave,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:22.960" end="00000:02:27.000"><span style="text">torej se ne vklopi,<br/>mrtev je, črte po ekranu,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:27.080" end="00000:02:29.520"><span style="text">takrat pa nastopimo elektroniki.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:30.520" end="00000:02:35.580"><span style="text">Sestavni del prenosnika je sistemska<br/>plošča in ta sistemska plošča</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:35.660" end="00000:02:40.960"><span style="text">velja kot glavni rezervni del in lahko<br/>zamenjamo samo sistemsko ploščo.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:41.140" end="00000:02:44.880"><span style="text">kaj več pa na njej menjati ne moremo,<br/>kar se tiče računalništva.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:44.960" end="00000:02:49.520"><span style="text">Takrat to ploščo pogledamo v elektroniki,<br/>jo popravimo.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:49.640" end="00000:02:54.440"><span style="text">To zahteva predvsej truda,<br/>zahteva izobrazba,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:54.520" end="00000:02:56.500"><span style="text">učimo se elektroniki celo življenje,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:02:56.580" end="00000:02:59.880"><span style="text">se izpopolnjujemo,<br/>sodelujemo z drugimi servisi.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:02.160" end="00000:03:06.840"><span style="text">Če nam uspe popraviti to ploščo,<br/>smo naredili veliko,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:06.920" end="00000:03:08.780"><span style="text">ker to so so zelo drage stvari.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:08.860" end="00000:03:14.920"><span style="text">In v večjih primerjih menjava te<br/>plošče v prenosniku ni smiselna,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:15.000" end="00000:03:19.320"><span style="text">ker je cena te plošče skoraj<br/>toliko kot novi prenosnik.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:19.400" end="00000:03:21.260"><span style="text">Popravilo plošče je smiselno,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:21.340" end="00000:03:24.960"><span style="text">ker naša stvoritev je relativno</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:25.040" end="00000:03:29.040"><span style="text">poceni proti ceni nove plošče.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:29.160" end="00000:03:34.040"><span style="text">S popravilom tudi naredimo,<br/>da prenosnik deluje dlje časa,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:34.120" end="00000:03:36.660"><span style="text">ker imamo nekako nadzor<br/>nad to elektroniko,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:36.740" end="00000:03:39.720"><span style="text">ki to znamo popravljati.<br/>Ni nas strah reklamacije.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:39.800" end="00000:03:43.740"><span style="text">Torej si upamo elektroniki reci,<br/>da ta prenosnik bo deloval,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:43.820" end="00000:03:46.287"><span style="text">dokler ga stranka želi imeti na mizi.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:50.690" end="00000:03:55.090"><span style="text">Tukaj bomo samo še pogledali na hitro,<br/>kakšna je enota spominska,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:55.930" end="00000:03:58.930"><span style="text">da vam povemo okvirne<br/>stroške popravila.</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:03:59.470" end="00000:04:02.210"><span style="text">Potem bomo prenosnik<br/>pregledali bolj natačno</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:04:02.290" end="00000:04:04.370"><span style="text">in vam poslali ponudbo za popravilo,</span></p>
        <p region="bottom" style="text" begin="00000:04:04.450" end="00000:04:05.717"><span style="text">da se lahko odločite.</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
